{"data":{"id":"UqtuSJFwopk","slug":"sister-nancy","title":"Sister Nancy","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"Gl30KrN7Afs","slug":"bam-bam-jenovah-remix","title":"Bam Bam (Jenovah Remix)"},{"id":"jr1IwTawhMs","slug":"bam-bam","title":"Bam Bam"},{"id":"pisfgRZMa_g","slug":"roof-over-mi-head","title":"Roof Over Mi Head"},{"id":"2v3CUtPT-p8","slug":"pegion-rock","title":"Pegion Rock"}]},"markers":[{"id":"_h5wFaRG8WQ","position":7,"timestamp":"00:05:50","rawTrack":"Sister Nancy - Bam Bam","track":{"id":"jr1IwTawhMs","path":"/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam/","slug":"bam-bam","title":"Bam Bam","artist":{"slug":"sister-nancy","title":"Sister Nancy"},"artwork":"images/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ymbEftQiGo8","slug":"all-day-2020","tags":[19],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2020","artwork":"/images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2020.jpg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2020 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set), [Sasha Marie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Skinny Macho's Set","position":3}},{"id":"4-tFYtZYgtc","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sister Nancy - Bam Bam","track":{"id":"jr1IwTawhMs","path":"/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam/","slug":"bam-bam","title":"Bam Bam","artist":{"slug":"sister-nancy","title":"Sister Nancy"},"artwork":"images/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"p1pSbRuL7vA","slug":"timeless-sounds-10-year-mix","tags":[6,6],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/us/room/1562052422"},"state":"published","title":"Timeless Sounds 10 Year Mix","artwork":"images/episodes/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix.jpg","content":"\n9 mixes from our heavy hitters. \nSounds from all over the world\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAired exclusively on Apple Music.\n\nJump to: \n\n- [Joe Kay](#joe-kay)\n- [Shaka Lion](#shaka-lion)\n- [JAEL](#jael)\n- [Andre Power](#andre-power)\n- [KRONIKA](#kronika)\n- [ESTA.](#esta)\n- [Sasha Marie](#sasha-marie)\n- [IAMNOBODI](#iamnobodi)\n- [Jared Jackson](#jared-jackson)","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":0,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T16:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Sasha Marie","position":6}},{"id":"kptFDKqArwg","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sister Nancy - Bam Bam","track":{"id":"jr1IwTawhMs","path":"/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam/","slug":"bam-bam","title":"Bam Bam","artist":{"slug":"sister-nancy","title":"Sister Nancy"},"artwork":"images/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9vaV0x1cIVc","slug":"152","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-152-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #152 w/ LIKE (Pac Div)","artwork":"/images/episodes/152.jpg","content":"\n\nDue to all the adversity we went through with this show we had [LIKE](https://soundcloud.com/callmelike) play music past the last hour and extend all the way for a total of 3 hours & 39 minutes. \n<!--more-->\n\nFrom the very first minute to the very end we were providing music that you never heard of or forgot about, configuring wires, figuring out audio issues, chopping it up about food, you name it. So much effort went into producing this show. We want to thank our brother LIKE for rolling through and blessing us with a proper DJ set, freestyle over Esta's beat, and talking to us about his experiences growing up and being in Pac Div. This man has traveled the world, played alongside the best in the game, and has also produced for/with the best (Kendrick, The Neptunes, ect). Joe Kay made sure to touch on topics that are very insightful. LIKE will be releasing with us on Soulection so stay tuned! \n\nFollow LIKE on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Callmelike) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/clearlyitslike/) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/callmeLike/)\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":13189,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"LIKE's Set","position":1}},{"id":"kK4Q-stgURw","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sister Nancy - Bam Bam (Jenovah Remix)","track":{"id":"Gl30KrN7Afs","path":"/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam-jenovah-remix/","slug":"bam-bam-jenovah-remix","title":"Bam Bam (Jenovah Remix)","artist":{"slug":"sister-nancy","title":"Sister Nancy"},"artwork":"images/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam-jenovah-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"B61JkVesUJw","slug":"232","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-232"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #232 (Europe Edition)","artwork":"/images/episodes/232.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7326,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-10-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"-qYOX-AsA7g","position":25,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sister Nancy - Bam Bam (Jenovah Remix)","track":{"id":"Gl30KrN7Afs","path":"/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam-jenovah-remix/","slug":"bam-bam-jenovah-remix","title":"Bam Bam (Jenovah Remix)","artist":{"slug":"sister-nancy","title":"Sister Nancy"},"artwork":"images/artists/sister-nancy/tracks/bam-bam-jenovah-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"G